pipewire: pipewire (multimedia server, rebuilt with LV2 support)
pipewire:
pipewire: PipeWire handles audio and video streams. This is Slackware's own
pipewire: package rebuilt with -Dlv2=enabled, so its filter-chain module can
pipewire: load LV2 plugins. Its pipewire-enable.sh, pipewire-disable.sh and
pipewire: autostart samples are left out: asahi-audio turns PipeWire on.
pipewire:
pipewire: Stock Slackware builds this with lv2=auto, which silently resolves
pipewire: to disabled because lilv is not packaged. asahi-audio needs LV2.
pipewire:
pipewire: Homepage: https://pipewire.org
